  "articleBody": "A successful primary bathroom remodel starts with a defined scope, a workable layout, and a contractor who can coordinate design, permits, plumbing, electrical work, finishes, and inspections. Before signing, compare written proposals, confirm who handles approvals, review material allowances, and discuss how existing conditions could affect the final plan.",
